Scope
-----
The Apache License 2.0 covers the original work in this project only.
Third-party components keep their own licenses; see THIRD_PARTY.md and the
licenses/ folder. Main components:

- model3recomp, sp00nznet (MIT): board runtime and PowerPC recompiler.
- LostWorldNative, snicolast (MIT): Real3D scene decoder and renderer,
  also ported to WGSL for the web version.
- Musashi 68000 core, Karl Stenerud (license kept with its source).
- SoftFloat, John R. Hauser (license kept with its source).
- MAME-derived parts (BSD-3-Clause): 315-5881 security cipher and
  Model 3 communication board research. Notices in licenses/.
- PL_MPEG, Dominic Szablewski (MIT): MP2 decoder for the music board.
- miniz (MIT): ROM ZIP reading.
- Sega Rally Recomp link transport (BSD-3-Clause), native build only.
- SDL3 (zlib), native build only.
- PeerJS, Michelle Bu and Eric Zhang (MIT), web version.
- VT323 font (SIL Open Font License 1.1), web version.

Files kept under reference/ for comparison keep their original notices and
licenses (including GPL-3.0 files from Supermodel); they are not part of the
built program and are not relicensed.

